            // About
            section#about.resume-section
                .resume-section-content
                    h1.mb-0
                        | Bonifacio
                        span.text-primary  Conde Jr
                    .subheading.mb-1 Senior iOS &amp; Flutter Engineer
                    .subheading.mb-5
                        | Cebu, Philippines · Remote (GMT+8, overlaps EU/MENA) · <a href="mailto:jay.r.conde24@gmail.com">jay.r.conde24@gmail.com</a>
                    p.lead.mb-4
                        | I’ve been an engineer since 2007, most of it on iOS, with the rest across cross‑platform mobile and POS and retail systems. At Solo, I helped build white‑label iOS apps and iPad kiosk software for F&amp;B brands; after the product was acquired by Foodics in 2022, I continued contributing to their mobile apps in Swift and Flutter.
                    p.lead.mb-5
                        | Much of my work has been on the practical side of engineering — making releases repeatable across many branded builds, keeping older codebases stable, and ensuring kiosk and printer hardware behave reliably in real service conditions. I’ve collaborated remotely with teams in Riyadh, Singapore, and Australia for most of the past decade, and I’m comfortable taking ownership of a codebase or supporting an existing one.
                    .social-icons
                        a.social-icon(href='https://linkedin.com/in/bonifacio-conde-ios', target='_blank', rel='noopener', aria-label='LinkedIn')
